### 1. Get or Initialize Default Board (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/default

### 2. Get All Boards
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/boards
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 3. Get All Tasks for Default Board
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/board/board-default
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 4. Create a New Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boardId": "board-default",
  "columnId": "col-todo",
  "title": "Setup Prometheus Metrics Dashboard",
  "description": "Expose microservice memory, GC and throughput metrics.",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "estimatedHours": 6.5,
  "coverColor": "#3b82f6"
}

### 5. Move Task to Another Column (e.g. In Progress)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/task-1/move
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetColumnId": "col-in-progress",
  "targetIndex": 0
}

### 6. Add Comment to Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/task-1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Branch feature/prometheus-metrics is created and ready for review!"
}

### 7. Add Checklist Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/task-1/checklist
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Add Grafana dashboard JSON config"
}

### 8. Healthcheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
